<title>ESTONIA: BALTICS-BALTIC 30 INDEX UP 1.19 PCT TO 121.41.</title>
<headline>BALTICS-BALTIC 30 INDEX UP 1.19 PCT TO 121.41.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic 30 index, the only pan-Baltic index, which is compiled by the three leading business newspapers, rose by 1.19 percent to 121.41 on Friday, Auguat 1, Estonia's Aripaev said.</p>
<p>The Baltic 30 index covers the 10 leading stocks from the three Baltic stock markets and is compiled by Aripaev, Lithuania's Verslo Zinios and Latvia's Dienas Bizness.</p>
<p>The index started from 100 on May 19.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202/1, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
